<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom updates rates for new Telenotes.</title>
<headline>Telecom updates rates for new Telenotes.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom New Zealand Limited on Thursday set new terms for interest bearing TeleNotes being issued under a debt programme started last month.</p>
<p>For an initial term of five years, the company is offering investors 7.75 percent and for a nine-year term the rate is 8.00 percent.</p>
<p>The other terms and conditions remain as set by an earlier prospectus, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
